# Configuration for the hourly production image retention timer.
#
# The scheduled run is a READ-ONLY manifest: scripts/post-deploy.sh plans the
# removals and deletes nothing. Uncommenting the line below is the explicit,
# separately approved change that enables deletion -- see
# docs/literouter-baseline/pr-merge-runbook.md#production-image-retention.
# First-run removal of already accumulated images is historical cleanup and
# needs its own approval, independent of enabling the timer.
# LITEROUTER_APPLY=false
#
# Derivation overrides (defaults shown). Both tags are derived from the live
# `literouter` container, never from image age.
# LITEROUTER_CONTAINER=literouter
# LITEROUTER_STATE_FILE=/var/tmp/9router-image-retention/state
PATH=/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin
